  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zPbbpW8.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"119\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Luminous 是一個旨在改善 Minecraft 發光物品和方塊的材質包。如果你曾經玩過或看過其他帶有火把、燈籠等元素的遊戲，通常會看到角色手持物品時帶有動畫和實際模型。這就是這個材質包實現的效果！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q2x0yPi.png\" width=\"450\" height=\"253\"></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px\">注意：此材質包搭配光影或僅使用 Optifine 時效果最佳</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BRivw2D.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"412\" height=\"41\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🔦 火把和燈籠具有新模型和物品模型</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🎞️ 火把帶有火焰動畫</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🔥 火把和燈籠具備自發光材質</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XigXLDL.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"412\" height=\"41\"></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>選項＞視訊設定＞畫質</p>\n<p>自發光材質：開啟</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jzzjd5z.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"412\" height=\"41\"></p><p>-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/visible-ores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visible Ores</a></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/10XlIcD.png\" width=\"151\" height=\"85\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/moconnect\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoConnect</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\">🍃<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/techys-bushy-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Techy's Bushy Leaves</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/F6JU9PM.jpg\"></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>版本發布</p>\n<p>為燈籠新增功能</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2>&nbsp;</h2>",
